* SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
* Original eight-byte SVC24 output request; no extended options.
         MACRO
&N       DEVTYPE &DDNAME,&AREA
         AIF   ('&DDNAME' EQ '' OR '&AREA' EQ '').BAD
&N       LA    1,&DDNAME
         LA    0,&AREA
         SVC   24
         MEXIT
.BAD     MNOTE 8,'DEVTYPE requires DDNAME and output-area addresses'
         MEND
